{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Unit Test.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Unit Test.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"unit test unit test","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Unit Test.md","fileName":"Unit Test.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Unit Test","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 15:58\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Agile Engineering and Quality]] [[Web Application Testing]] [[C Sharp Functions Diagnostics and Testing]] [[ASP.NET Core API Integration Testing]] [[Test-Driven Development and Unit Test Design]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Agile Engineering and Quality","Web Application Testing","C Sharp Functions Diagnostics and Testing","ASP.NET Core API Integration Testing","Test-Driven Development and Unit Test Design","Testing Pyramid","Moq","In-Memory Database Provider","Angular TestBed","Jasmine","Test Double","Arrange-Act-Assert","c8andnetcore30projectsusingazure.pdf","agilegamedevelopment2e.pdf","aspnetcore3andangular9_3ed.pdf","c80andnetcore30moderncross-platformdevelopment.pdf","hands-onrestfulwebserviceswithaspnetcore3.pdf","hands-onsoftwarearchitecturewithc8andnetcore3.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Unit Test.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Unit Test.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"unit test unit test","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Unit Test.md","fileName":"Unit Test.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Unit Test","heading":"Unit Test","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A unit test is a fast automated check of a small piece of software behavior in controlled conditions. It gives developers immediate evidence about local correctness and supports safe refactoring.\n\nIts narrow scope should isolate external collaborators, arrange deterministic state, and express a specific expectation. Unit tests can be wrong, but independently written tests and implementation are unlikely to reproduce exactly the same error.\n\nMany unit tests form the fast base of a [[Testing Pyramid]], but they cannot prove that assets, systems, platforms, and player-facing behavior work together. Broader integration and playthrough tests supply that evidence.\n\nIn a full-stack web application, unit tests can isolate ASP.NET Core controller behavior with [[Moq]] and an [[In-Memory Database Provider]], or isolate Angular components with [[Angular TestBed]], [[Jasmine]], and a [[Test Double]]. [[Arrange-Act-Assert]] keeps setup, execution, and verification distinct.\n\nThe web-research chapter emphasizes that test code has a maintenance cost and should prove a useful behavior. Its controller/database example spans multiple components and is therefore described cautiously rather than being labeled a pure single-unit test.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Agile Engineering and Quality","Web Application Testing","C Sharp Functions Diagnostics and Testing","ASP.NET Core API Integration Testing","Test-Driven Development and Unit Test Design","Testing Pyramid","Moq","In-Memory Database Provider","Angular TestBed","Jasmine","Test Double","Arrange-Act-Assert","c8andnetcore30projectsusingazure.pdf","agilegamedevelopment2e.pdf","aspnetcore3andangular9_3ed.pdf","c80andnetcore30moderncross-platformdevelopment.pdf","hands-onrestfulwebserviceswithaspnetcore3.pdf","hands-onsoftwarearchitecturewithc8andnetcore3.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Unit Test.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Unit Test.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"unit test unit test","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Unit Test.md","fileName":"Unit Test.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Unit Test","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[c8andnetcore30projectsusingazure.pdf]]\n\n[[agilegamedevelopment2e.pdf]]\n\n[[aspnetcore3andangular9_3ed.pdf]]\n[[c80andnetcore30moderncross-platformdevelopment.pdf]]\n[[hands-onrestfulwebserviceswithaspnetcore3.pdf]]\n[[hands-onsoftwarearchitecturewithc8andnetcore3.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Agile Engineering and Quality","Web Application Testing","C Sharp Functions Diagnostics and Testing","ASP.NET Core API Integration Testing","Test-Driven Development and Unit Test Design","Testing Pyramid","Moq","In-Memory Database Provider","Angular TestBed","Jasmine","Test Double","Arrange-Act-Assert","c8andnetcore30projectsusingazure.pdf","agilegamedevelopment2e.pdf","aspnetcore3andangular9_3ed.pdf","c80andnetcore30moderncross-platformdevelopment.pdf","hands-onrestfulwebserviceswithaspnetcore3.pdf","hands-onsoftwarearchitecturewithc8andnetcore3.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}